  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = √10 + √3\n\ny = √10 - √3\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n(a - b)² = a² + b² - 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ x² = (√10 + √3)²\n\n⇒ x² = 10 + 3 + 2√30 = 13 + 2√30\n\n⇒ y² = (√10 - √3)²\n\n⇒ y² = 10 + 3 - 2√30 = 13 - 2√30\n\n⇒ x² + y² = (13 + 2√30) + (13 - 2√30)\n\n⇒ x² + y² = 26\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 26.**",
